class LanguageDef #DBEAFE {
  + **name : syn::Ident**   — a Rust-identifier coupling (W-3b)
  + options : HashMap<String, AttributeValue>
  + extends_names / include_names / mixin_names : Vec<Ident>
  + types : Vec<LangType>
  + refinement_types : Vec<RefinementTypeDef>
  + token_defs : Vec<TokenDef>
  + mode_defs : Vec<ModeDef>
  + sync_constraints : Vec<SyncConstraint>
  + tree_invariants : Vec<TreeInvariant>
  + terms : Vec<GrammarRule>
  + equations : Vec<Equation>
  + rewrites : Vec<RewriteRule>
  + logic : Option<LogicBlock>
  + guard_config : Option<GuardConfig>
}

class LangType #FEE2E2 {
  + name : Ident
  + **native_type : Option<syn::Type>**  <latex>\;\bigstar_1</latex>   model.rs:918
  + collection_kind : Option<CollectionCategory>
}

class GrammarRule #FEE2E2 {
  + label : Ident
  + category : Ident
  + term_context : Option<Vec<TermParam>>
  + syntax_pattern : Option<Vec<SyntaxExpr>>
  + **rust_code : Option<RustCodeBlock>**  <latex>\;\bigstar_2</latex>   grammar.rs:247
  + eval_mode : Option<EvalMode>
  + is_right_assoc : bool
  + prefix_bp : Option<u8>
}

class RustCodeBlock #FEE2E2 {
  + **code : syn::Expr**   types.rs:192 — the payload of <latex>\bigstar_2</latex>
}

class TokenDef #FEE2E2 {
  + name : Ident
  + pattern : String
  + category : Option<Ident>
  + **rust_code : Option<TokenStream>**  <latex>\;\bigstar_3</latex>   model.rs:1689
  + priority / push_mode / is_pop / stream
}

class LogicBlock #FEE2E2 {
  + relations : Vec<RelationDecl>
  + **content : TokenStream**  <latex>\;\bigstar_4</latex>   model.rs:68
}

class TheoryRegistration #FEE2E2 {
  + name : Ident
  + **theory_type : syn::Type**  <latex>\;\bigstar_5</latex>   model.rs:637
  + handled_types : Option<Vec<Ident>>
}

class Equation #DCFCE7 {
  + name, type_context, premises
  + left : Pattern
  + right : Pattern
}
class RewriteRule #DCFCE7 {
  + name, type_context, premises
  + left : Pattern
  + right : Pattern
}
class GuardConfig #FEF3C7 {
  + builtin_predicates
  + connectives
  + channels
  .. declarative in itself, but it ..
  .. //composes// a Rust-bearing member ..
}

LanguageDef *-- LangType
LanguageDef *-- GrammarRule
LanguageDef *-- TokenDef
LanguageDef *-- LogicBlock
LanguageDef *-- Equation
LanguageDef *-- RewriteRule
LanguageDef *-- GuardConfig
GrammarRule *-- RustCodeBlock
GuardConfig *-- TheoryRegistration

note as N #F1F5F9
  **Five specification fields carry Rust — measured, not asserted.**
  Reproduce from the mettail-rust worktree root with

  ""rg -n '^\s*pub [a-z_0-9]+\s*:\s*(Option<)?(Vec<)?(syn::)?(Type|Expr|TokenStream|RustCodeBlock)\b' ast/src --glob '*.rs'""

  which returns **ten** field declarations. Five are specification content
  (<latex>\bigstar_1</latex> through <latex>\bigstar_5</latex>); one is <latex>\bigstar_2</latex>'s payload (RustCodeBlock::code);
  three are //codegen output// in pattern.rs (VariableBinding::expression :484,
  AscentClauses::clauses :492 and ::equational_checks :495); one is a
  //codegen-analysis field// (grammar_shapes.rs:453 channel_expr). Two further
  ""syn"" couplings escape any type predicate and are listed separately in §I.4:
  ""LanguageDef::name : syn::Ident"" and ""LanguageRef::module_path : syn::Path""
  (compose.rs:38).

  <latex>\bigstar_1</latex> and <latex>\bigstar_5</latex> are type **NAMES**; <latex>\bigstar_2</latex>, <latex>\bigstar_3</latex> and <latex>\bigstar_4</latex> are executable Rust **CODE**.
end note

legend right
  |= Colour |= Concept (pinned palette, diagrams/PALETTE.md) |
  |<#DBEAFE> | **P4** The shared specification datatype — here, the root record |
  |<#FEE2E2> | **P6** Carries a Rust type or Rust code |
  |<#DCFCE7> | **P5** Fully declarative — no Rust anywhere |
  |<#FEF3C7> | **P2** Declarative itself, but composes a Rust-bearing member |
  |<#F1F5F9> | **P14** Out-of-band note (measurement) |
endlegend
